@startuml
' Sequence diagram: invoking a command via the CLI
actor User as U
participant CLI
participant discover_commands
participant CommandModule

U -> CLI: sirius <command>
CLI -> discover_commands: discover_commands()
discover_commands --> CLI: CommandSpec list
CLI -> CommandModule: load module & call main()
CommandModule --> CLI: result / exit code
CLI --> U: return status

@enduml
